Package: flexMatch
Title: Flexible Matching for Stacked Difference-in-Differences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Aleksandr", "Kazakov", email = "avkazakov@proton.me",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools for building stacked difference-in-differences samples in
    staggered-adoption settings. The package labels valid treated and control
    candidates, performs cross-sectional matching, expands matched units into
    event-time stacks, and returns diagnostics for balance assessment and
    visualization.
